  "label": "monkey is mapped as 'black children' in the racist metaphor",
  "description": "The visual entity 'monkey' is mapped onto the textual entity 'black children' through the meme's racist metaphor. The monkey, positioned at the top with the text 'stop racism', is juxtaposed with the baby and the text 'black children and white children are the same', creating an analogical mapping where the monkey visually represents Black children in a dehumanizing way. This mapping is part of the anti-Black stereotype of comparing Black people to primates.",
